+## 2.3.1
+
+### Bugfixes
+
+- Fixed `mt.gsea` giving p-values of 0 when no permutation reached the observed score. The observed score is now counted as one of the permutations, as in `mt.waggr` (#383)
+
 ## 2.3.0
 
 ### Changes
